    description: "DEEP bakeoff found three distinct cross-language dispatch gaps: (1) Proto/gRPC/ttrpc to Go handler: fccontrol.proto CreateVM route stops at grpc_service node, never reaches Go service.CreateVM. (2) Solidity-to-TypeScript ABI bridges: 0 TS↔Solidity edges in osx despite deploy scripts calling ABI wrappers. (3) Electron IPC: Signal-Desktop has 24 of ~100 IPC channels linked. These are all variants of the same structural problem: dispatch-based invocation across language/process boundaries."  # cd9c
